---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Slay the Spire 2 Co-op Guide &mdash; Master Multiplayer"
  description="Comprehensive Slay the Spire 2 co-op guide covering team compositions, card synergies, boss strategies, and advanced tips for 2-4 player multiplayer."
>
  <section class="text-center py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4">
      Slay the Spire 2 Co-op Guide
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
      Master the Spire with friends. In-depth strategies for 2-4 player co-op:
      team compositions, card synergies, boss tactics, and advanced multiplayer mechanics.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 mb-12">
    <a href="/coop/" class="block bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Co-op Overview</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Core mechanics, rules, and 10 essential tips for multiplayer success.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/coop/character-combos/" class="block bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Character Combos</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Best team comps for 2/3/4 players. Synergy matrix and role framework.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/coop/card-synergies/" class="block bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Card Synergies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Co-op exclusive cards, cross-character combos, and card tier rankings.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/coop/boss-strategies/" class="block bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Boss Strategies</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">How co-op changes each boss fight. Scaling, targeting, and team tactics.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/coop/advanced-tips/" class="block bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700 hover:border-amber-500 transition-colors">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-2">Advanced Tips</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">Relic drafting, map voting, Ascension co-op rules, and resource management.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-slate-700">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-400 mb-4">Getting Started with Co-op</h2>
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300">
      <p>
        Slay the Spire 2 introduces <strong class="text-white">4-player online co-op</strong> for the first time in the series.
        Each player controls their own character with an independent deck, relics, and gold,
        but shares the map, enemies, and fate with the team.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        <strong class="text-white">Key difference from solo:</strong> Enemies scale with player count,
        debuffs (Vulnerable, Weak, Poison) benefit the entire team, and dead players auto-revive
        after combat if at least one teammate survives. Coordination is everything.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3">
        <a href="/coop/" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline font-semibold">Read the full co-op guide &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
